WEBVTT

00:01:57.897 --> 00:02:01.930
design buildings. And one of the things
that came out of her research was

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.663
a very simple visual tool,

00:02:03.663 --> 00:02:06.997
the business model canvas that
allows any entrepreneur

00:02:06.997 --> 00:02:12.263
and any business model to turn their idea
into something concrete and visual.

00:02:12.663 --> 00:02:15.963
The business model canvas basically
has nine building blocks.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.630
You first define who are
your customer segments,

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.063
who are you creating value for?

00:02:21.597 --> 00:02:25.897
What's the value proposition for each
one of these customer segments?

00:02:26.397 --> 00:02:29.663
How are you reaching these customers
through which channels